(7760319, 1285203, 63398, '<td valign="top">When I first looked at this, I thought it was some kind of grid that appears to run horizontally ending at/near the building with the silo roof to the left of what looks like the end of the grid. The building with the cylindrical sectors seems to be underneath my grid. So now I''ve had my optical delusion, thank you very much and this gets a 9 for bamfoozling the daylights outta me.</td>', 'When I first looked at this, I thought it was some kind of grid that appears to run horizontally ending at/near the building with the silo roof to the left of what looks like the end of the grid. The building with the cylindrical sectors seems to be underneath my grid. So now I''ve had my optical delusion, thank you very much and this gets a 9 for bamfoozling the daylights outta me.', '2023-11-23 23:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
