(7760331, 1285042, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by GinaRothfels:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on your 4 blues. It''s a wonderful achievement.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> are you KIDDING ME .. !!!! .. <br/>i thought three blues in a row was amazing ..<br/>not sure .. but is this a record .. 4 in a row .. <br/>has anyone else got 4 blues in a row .. maybe except for Christophe .. but he''s almost out of our league here .. no offense to anyone .. <br/>anyway .. a huge CONGRATULATIONS .. bet you didnt think you were heading for a blue with a 6.5 .. ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Christophe only entered selected challenges, so I doubt he had 4 on the front page at the same time. Maybe 4 entries in a row that got the blue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I just wasn''t sure if I could achieve 4 in a row, I figured it could be possible judging by the score, but then it did drop a bit towards the end. I was super stoked to see it at first place. Would love to know if SC knows if anyone has achieved this??</td>', 'Originally posted by GinaRothfels: Congratulations on your 4 blues. It''s a wonderful achievement. Originally posted by roz: are you KIDDING ME .. !!!! .. i thought three blues in a row was amazing ..not sure .. but is this a record .. 4 in a row .. has anyone else got 4 blues in a row .. maybe except for Christophe .. but he''s almost out of our league here .. no offense to anyone .. anyway .. a huge CONGRATULATIONS .. bet you didnt think you were heading for a blue with a 6.5 .. ;)   Christophe only entered selected challenges, so I doubt he had 4 on the front page at the same time. Maybe 4 entries in a row that got the blue.   I just wasn''t sure if I could achieve 4 in a row, I figured it could be possible judging by the score, but then it did drop a bit towards the end.