e with a 6.5 .. ;)   Christophe only entered selected challenges, so I doubt he had 4 on the front page at the same time. Maybe 4 entries in a row that got the blue.   I just wasn''t sure if I could achieve 4 in a row, I figured it could be possible judging by the score, but then it did drop a bit towards the end. I was super stoked to see it at first place. Would love to know if SC knows if anyone has achieved this??   This is an amazing achievement, Anita!!! Youre on one heck of a roll. ', '2023-11-26 12:28:18.000000', '2023-11-26 12:28:42.000000', 0),
